PROJECT INVISIBLE - SamplerScheduler
Third-party components and their licences
================================================================================

This extension contains no new sampler mathematics. Every implementation is a
merged or ported copy of existing work. This file records what came from where,
so the provenance of any line can be traced back to its upstream.

The combined work is distributed under AGPL-3.0 with the additional RES4LYF
restriction reproduced in LICENSE. Where a component's own licence is more
permissive (MIT, Apache-2.0), that permissive licence still governs that
component taken on its own.

