1. RES4LYF                                    AGPL-3.0 + non-commercial-service
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Upstream : https://github.com/ClownsharkBatwing/RES4LYF
   Via      : https://github.com/Haoming02/sd-webui-forge-classic (neo) port
   Files    : lib/wrappers/res4lyf/**
              lib/wrappers/res4lyf_bridge.py
   Provides : RES 2M/3M/2S/3S/5S/6S, their ODE variants, DEIS 2M/3M and ODE
              variants (16 samplers), the Tan and Beta57 schedules, and the DEIS
              coefficient tables reused by the ported DEIS sampler.

   THIS COMPONENT CARRIES THE COMMERCIAL-SERVICE RESTRICTION. It is the reason
   LICENSE opens with that rider. See LICENSE for the exact wording and for how
   to build without it.

   Modified here: lib/wrappers/res4lyf/_compat.py. The upstream shim replaced
   the whole `comfy` module in sys.modules; this version adopts the host's
   vendored `comfy` package and only fills in absent submodules, so it no longer
   shadows Forge's LoRA and ControlNet helpers.

