2. ComfyUI                                                            GPL-3.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Upstream : https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI
   File     : lib/wrappers/comfy_ported.py
   Provides : iPNDM, iPNDM V, DEIS, DDPM, Heun++2, DPM2 a, DPM fast,
              DPM adaptive, and the DPMSolver / PIDStepSizeController machinery.
   Also     : lib/comfy_sync.py reads SAMPLER_NAMES / KSAMPLER_NAMES /
              SCHEDULER_NAMES from comfy/samplers.py over the network. It parses
              text only; no downloaded code is imported or executed.

   The maths is verbatim. Four host-API adaptations are documented in that
   file's header.

   Sub-components inside comfy_ported.py that carry their own, more permissive
   upstream licences:

     * iPNDM / iPNDM_v / DEIS ....... Apache-2.0
       https://github.com/zju-pi/diff-sampler
     * Heun++2 ...................... MIT
       https://github.com/Carzit/sd-webui-samplers-scheduler
     * DPMSolver, dpm_fast,
       dpm_adaptive ................. MIT
       https://github.com/crowsonkb/k-diffusion

